## 🧠 4. Operational Protocols

### 4.1 The "Critical Loop" (Self-Correction)
Code is no longer written blindly.
1.  **Developer** writes code.
2.  **Critic** reviews code (via [brain_critique_code](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/ai-mvp-backend/mcp-server-nucleus/src/mcp_server_nucleus/__init__.py#4224-4241)).
3.  **Developer** fixes code (via [brain_apply_critique](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/ai-mvp-backend/mcp-server-nucleus/src/mcp_server_nucleus/__init__.py#4244-4291)).
4.  *Only then* is it deployed.

### 4.2 The "Memory Bank" (Knowledge Retrieval)
Agents do not forget.
*   **Search:** [brain_search_memory("error 500")](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/ai-mvp-backend/mcp-server-nucleus/src/mcp_server_nucleus/__init__.py#4313-4328) checks for past solutions.
*   **Read:** [brain_read_memory("context")](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/ai-mvp-backend/mcp-server-nucleus/src/mcp_server_nucleus/__init__.py#4329-4344) ensures alignment with the Vision.

### 4.3 The "Swarm" (Multi-Agent Collaboration)
For complex tasks:
*   **Synthesizer** calls [brain_orchestrate_swarm(mission)](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/ai-mvp-backend/mcp-server-nucleus/src/mcp_server_nucleus/__init__.py#4294-4310).
*   A dedicated channel (`.brain/swarm/{id}`) is opened.
*   Agents collaborate until the goal is met.

